 --\u003e|falls back to| 3d\n    3c --\u003e|performs| 3e\n    \n    style Storage fill:#99e9f2\n    style SessionSave fill:#b2f2bb\n    style SessionRecall fill:#a5d8ff\n    style MemoryQuery fill:#ffec99\n    style SessionIdentity fill:#fcc2d7"
}